@startuml seq-inquiry
!include _style.iuml
title Commission / Contact Inquiry Flow
autonumber

actor Visitor
participant "Contact / Commission form" as Form
participant "/api/contact" as Api
database "Supabase DB" as DB
database "Storage\ninquiry-references (private)" as Store
participant "Resend" as Resend
actor Artist

Visitor -> Form : fills form (+ up to 5 photos)
Form -> Form : shrink photos to ≤1600px JPEG\n(drops GPS/metadata)
Form -> Api : POST multipart
Api -> Api : honeypot · validate · ≤3 per 10 min per email\n· JPEG only · ≤2 MB each
Api -> Store : upload reference photos
Api -> DB : insert inquiry
alt Resend configured
  Api -> Resend : email to artist (reply-to visitor)
end
Api --> Form : ok
Form --> Visitor : "Your message is on its way"
Artist -> DB : /admin/inquiries (signed links to photos)
Artist -> Artist : Reply by email · Mark replied · Delete
note right of Artist : Delete also removes its photos from storage
@enduml
